cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper that describes its RUNC
  family of algorithms (preferred-citation below); the software itself can be
  cited with the metadata in this file.
type: software
title: "dual: dualization algorithms for enumerating minimal covers of Boolean matrices"
abstract: >-
  C++17 library that enumerates all minimal covers of a Boolean matrix,
  equivalently the minimal transversals of a hypergraph (dualization of a
  monotone Boolean function), with the asymptotically optimal RUNC family of
  algorithms, resumable enumeration, a C ABI and a Python package.
authors:
  - family-names: Prokofyev
    given-names: Petr
    alias: ppprok
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ppprok/dual"
url: "https://ppprok.github.io/dual/"
keywords:
  - dualization
  - minimal covers
  - hypergraph transversals
  - hitting sets
  - Boolean matrix
  - enumeration algorithms
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "Construction and investigation of new asymptotically optimal algorithms for dualization"
  authors:
    - family-names: Djukova
      given-names: E. V.
    - family-names: Prokofjev
      given-names: P. A.
  journal: "Machine Learning and Data Analysis"
  year: 2014
  languages:
    - rus
